    {
      "topic": "staff",
      "sentiment": "mixed",
      "mentions": 21,
      "title": {
        "en": "Kind receptionists alongside clinical complaints"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Many visitors commend front desk receptionists for their welcoming greeting, accommodating check-in process, and courteous attitude toward arriving pet owners. In contrast, numerous critical clients express severe dissatisfaction with veterinary clinicians, specifically citing dismissive attitudes, eye-rolling, rushed examinations, and a perceived lack of empathy."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "place",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 8,
      "title": {
        "en": "Exceptionally clean clinical facility"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "A consistently praised feature of the hospital is its cleanliness and well-maintained facility. Reviewers frequently emphasize that the reception lobby, waiting areas, and examination rooms are kept spotless, creating a sanitary and comfortable environment for visiting cats and dogs, with only one client raising a concern regarding fleas."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "results",
      "sentiment": "negative",
      "mentions": 8,
      "title": {
        "en": "Frequent medical and diagnostic dissatisfaction"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "While two pet parents reported positive interventions for sick kittens and fevers, the overall balance of reviews highlights significant clinical dissatisfaction. Dissatisfied owners report chipped nail trimming, misdiagnosed ear conditions, sudden pressure toward surgical procedures, and tragic outcomes for severely ill companion animals."
      }
    }
  ],
